ent_paragraphs","paragraph_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p001","c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p002"],"rationale":"續接王翊附傳至下一傳目，中間無另一傳主。"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-063","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi-ws1513418","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p001","quote":"翊，字士遊，肅次兄琛子也。風神秀立，好學有文才。歷司空主簿、清河王友、中書侍郎。頗銳於榮利，結婚於元叉，超拜左將軍、濟州刺史，尋加平東將軍。清靜愛民，有政治之稱。入為散騎常侍。孝莊初，遷鎮南將軍、金紫光祿大夫，領國子祭酒。","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p001:m0000"},{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-063","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi-ws1513418","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p002","quote":"子淵，武定中，儀同開府記室參軍。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p002:m0032"}],"interpretation_note":"《魏書》原稱王翊之子。單一見證未定同一任職記載下的異名是否同人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-beishi-042-wangyi:p002","text":"卒，贈司空公、徐州刺史。子琛，武定中，儀同、開府記室參軍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-beishi-042-wangyi:p002:m0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"琛","kind":"person","person_id":"w34_b6a_3nn","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"承王翊傳末「子琛」；與另一傳的子嗣記載是否同人待考。"}],"chapter_id":"c-beishi-042-wangyi","book_id":"b-beishi-042","work_id":"w-beishi","source_id":"s-beishi-042-wangyi-ws2626092"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p001","text":"翊，字士遊，肅次兄琛子也。風神秀立，好學有文才。歷司空主簿、清河王友、中書侍郎。頗銳於榮利，結婚於元叉，超拜左將軍、濟州刺史，尋加平東將軍。清靜愛民，有政治之稱。入為散騎常侍。孝莊初，遷鎮南將軍、金紫光祿大夫，領國子祭酒。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-063-wangyi:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"s